# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS in opsi-enterprise-revamp. Replace the handles with real teams (same names as
# docs/commit-plan.md). Last matching pattern wins. Combine with branch protection "Require review from Code Owners".

*                                          @backend-leads

# Product code by area (docs/commit-plan.md)
/apps/opsi-api/app/modules/identity/       @security-team @backend-leads
/apps/opsi-api/app/modules/agents/         @ai-platform @backend-leads
/apps/opsi-api/app/modules/search/         @ai-platform
/apps/opsi-api/app/modules/chat/           @backend-leads
/apps/opsi-web/                            @frontend-leads
/apps/copilot-runtime/                     @ai-platform @frontend-leads
/services/ingestion/                       @data-platform
/database/migrations/                      @dba @backend-leads
/infrastructure/                           @platform-ops @security-team
/docs/adr/                                 @architects

# Anything that changes which third-party code we carry or depend on gets an extra pair of eyes
/third_party/                              @architects @open-source-review
/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md                    @open-source-review
/patches/                                  @architects
**/package.json                            @frontend-leads @architects
**/package-lock.json                       @frontend-leads @architects
/requirements/                             @backend-leads @architects

# Repository policy itself
/.github/                                  @architects @platform-ops
/.gitattributes                            @architects
/scripts/repo/                             @architects
